---
import {experiments} from '../../data/interface';
---
<section id="lab" class="lab section-pad"><div class="chapter mono"><span>05 / THE LAB</span><span>LESS CERTAINTY. MORE CURIOSITY.</span></div><div class="lab-intro"><h2 data-reveal>WHAT IF<span>?</span></h2><p>A place to pull at the edges.<br/>Small, live experiments built into this portfolio.</p></div><div class="lab-window"><div id="lab-track">{experiments.map(e=><article class={`experiment experiment-${e.className}`}><button class="experiment-preview" data-experiment={e.id} data-cursor="PLAY" aria-label={e.action}><div class="experiment-art" aria-hidden="true">{e.id==='reactor'?<div class="lab-orbits"><i/><i/><i/><i/><span>+</span></div>:e.id==='type'?<div class="lab-type">Aa<span>Bb</span></div>:<div class="lab-signal">{Array.from({length:25},(_,i)=><i style={`--i:${i}`}/>)}</div><span class="mono experiment-action">{e.action} ↗</span></button><div class="experiment-meta"><span class="mono">{e.number} / {e.kind}</span><h3>{e.title}</h3><p>{e.description}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
